{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54846","headline":"兵要望江南 占蛇第十九（京本列第二十一○十二首） 五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占蛇第十九（京本列第二十一○十二首） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长蛇见，饮水近营（京本作「军」）傍。\n抽退还乡方始吉，不然移寨九天方，禳厌免灾殃（辛本、川本末八字作「向高强，营垒布旌幢」。\n京本注：「太岁九天上同。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54846.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54846","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}